Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.40,0:00:09.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should organize and\Nhost an eating contest.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.26,0:00:10.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Allow me to explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.04,0:00:14.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that we've dealt with Chain\NRestaurant's fake Boxo scheme,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.90,0:00:17.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and with the walls around the village set
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.08,0:00:19.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to be completely fixed\Nin the next two weeks,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.72,0:00:22.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I predict we'll have a\Nlarge influx of people
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.24,0:00:24.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,coming to visit the\NClearflow Lake Stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.40,0:00:25.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.94,0:00:29.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The restaurant union should put\Non a big event to attract new
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.12,0:00:32.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,customers under the guise of\Ncelebrating the wall's completion.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.44,0:00:33.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.35,0:00:35.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why she suggested\Nan eating contest.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.84,0:00:36.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.18,0:00:39.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hunters love food and they\Ncan really pack it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.76,0:00:41.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We could have a grand\Nprize for the winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.80,0:00:43.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That way it'll drum up more excitement.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.66,0:00:47.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And with a small admission fee, we'll\Nbe able to easily cover the overhead.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.32,0:00:50.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to make sure whatever we\Nserve is as filling as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.54,0:00:52.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's aim to have the event in two weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.66,0:00:57.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll put up leaflets all around town and\Nget everybody talking about the contest!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.06,0:01:03.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad they figured it out,\Nbut did I need to be here?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.56,0:01:26.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.78,0:01:30.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.46,0:01:31.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:31.15,0:01:35.49,sign_1939_25_Reborn_as_a_Vend,title,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(773,1)\an8\fs20}Reborn as a Vending Machine, {\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020222&}I {\c&H161C79&}Now {\c&H1C379A&}Wander {\c&H1D6FE2&}the {\c&H2D9CED&}Dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.54,0:01:35.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.45,0:01:36.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.59,0:01:58.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can I not know?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.50,0:01:59.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't understand that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.41,0:02:00.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a kid. I'm a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.32,0:02:03.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.92,0:02:05.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a kid. I'm a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.88,0:02:07.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.08,0:02:08.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.70,0:02:11.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a kid. I'm a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.08,0:02:12.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a kid.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:34.09,0:02:39.01,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(110,285)\fad(734,1)\fsp.8}Gastric Measures
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.12,0:02:36.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.03,0:02:39.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxo, if you don't help\Nus, then we're done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.30,0:02:40.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.21,0:02:41.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't ambush Boxo like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.80,0:02:44.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't see why you'd need\Nhis help in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.56,0:02:47.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought you had the eating\Ncontest handled already.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.34,0:02:48.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, same here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.42,0:02:50.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I even plan on competing. We did.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.32,0:02:53.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's true that everything was going well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.08,0:02:57.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is, until we found out\Nthat they were entering.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.24,0:02:58.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.26,0:02:59.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Walking disasters.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.82,0:03:01.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The veins of eating competitions!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.38,0:03:05.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shui the Inhaler and the Band of\NGluttons have officially signed up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.00,0:03:07.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your stomach's like a bottomless pit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.60,0:03:08.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.51,0:03:10.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm just getting started. Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.42,0:03:12.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.76,0:03:17.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'd be bad enough if it was just a band\Nof gluttons, but Shui joining in, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.18,0:03:19.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't figure out how they can\Nfit that much in their bellies.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.94,0:03:23.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we have to feed them all, we're\Ngoing to go way into the red!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.24,0:03:25.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it even possible to get that much food?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.42,0:03:27.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We worked as hard as we could\Nto make this event a success,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.02,0:03:30.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but everything we did\Nwas completely pointless!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.44,0:03:31.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're trying to figure out how to fill
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.96,0:03:34.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,up those bottomless\Npits they call stomachs.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.34,0:03:37.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have any items\Nthat could help them out?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.48,0:03:45.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I think I've had one of these before.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.10,0:03:48.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a sweet drink that\Nbubbles in your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.38,0:03:50.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They can be pretty filling, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.62,0:03:53.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you suggesting we provide\Nthis to contestants during
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.44,0:03:56.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the competition so they\Nfill up faster and eat less?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.00,0:03:57.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.10,0:04:00.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That could work. Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.48,0:04:02.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If this drink is more filling than water,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.48,0:04:04.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if people\Nwould complain about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.50,0:04:05.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.66,0:04:07.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know I'd have a problem with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.60,0:04:10.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps we could let them choose\Nwhich beverage they'd like to drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.78,0:04:13.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does that give those who\Npick water an advantage?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.66,0:04:16.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who would choose water\Nover this tasty drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.14,0:04:17.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, how about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.76,0:04:21.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For now, let's advertise this drink\Nwhile increasing its price. Then,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.08,0:04:23.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we'll spread the word that\Nparticipants can drink
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.04,0:04:26.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as much of it as they\Nwant during the contest.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.36,0:04:27.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.76,0:04:30.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one would pass up the\Nchance to drink it then.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.94,0:04:34.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Mr. Boxo!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.96,0:04:38.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you could find it in your heart to\Nsell us this drink at a reasonable price,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.70,0:04:39.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we'd be in your debt!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.20,0:04:41.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.46,0:04:44.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew we could count on you, Boxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.02,0:04:48.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think you could stick around the\Ncontest to make sure it all goes smoothly?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.88,0:04:49.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.70,0:04:57.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at that crowd.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.00,0:05:00.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need more meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.98,0:05:01.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.98,0:05:04.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got a fresh delivery from\Nsome hunters in the storeroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.96,0:05:07.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know better than to ask\Nwhat kind of meat it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.62,0:05:10.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen, thank\Nyou so much for waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.06,0:05:13.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On behalf of the restaurant union,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.16,0:05:17.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'd like to welcome you to the Clearflow\NLake Stratum's first eating contest.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.28,0:05:21.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got more entries than we expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.92,0:05:24.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, after a short elimination round,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.08,0:05:26.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we've sorted the remaining\Ncontestants into two separate blocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.06,0:05:30.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The best five eaters from each group\Nwill then advance to the finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.02,0:05:34.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've prepared an incredible\Ngrand prize for today's champion.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.20,0:05:35.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We wish you the best of luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.66,0:05:40.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, could all competitors\Nin Block 1 come on stage?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.84,0:05:42.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, all Block 1 eaters.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.36,0:05:51.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have until the very last grain of\Nsand falls to the bottom of the hourglass.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.78,0:05:53.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Contestants must finish\Nall the food on their
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.62,0:05:55.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,plate before time is\Nup in order to advance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.02,0:05:57.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, you have to eat fast, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.88,0:06:00.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as there aren't\Nany other questions,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.60,0:06:03.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we're going to kick off\Nthis eating contest.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.40,0:06:05.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get ready, set, eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.22,0:06:20.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I get second?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.02,0:06:23.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I cleaned my plane. Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.20,0:06:26.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm finished over here as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.52,0:06:28.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Four contestants have finished already.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.78,0:06:31.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a race for Block One's last spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.36,0:06:34.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe that honor belongs to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.80,0:06:35.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There you have it, folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.80,0:06:39.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These five have qualified\Nbefore the time limit. Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.94,0:06:41.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're all monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.16,0:06:45.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, Goat Guy's the only human in\Nblock one to move up to the finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.66,0:06:47.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The band of gluttons are amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.02,0:06:49.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for participating.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.44,0:06:51.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can take home any leftovers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.04,0:06:54.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alrighty then, it's\Ntime for us to move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.42,0:06:58.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would all contestants in block two\Nplease make your way to the stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.44,0:07:05.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm rooting for you, Miss Shirley!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.60,0:07:06.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Woo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.51,0:07:08.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's surprising to see Shirley here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.46,0:07:11.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would have never expected\Nthat she was a big eater.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.28,0:07:13.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope everyone in block two is hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.96,0:07:15.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get ready, set, eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.08,0:07:37.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I looked away for a second, and\Nshe'd already cleaned her plate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.10,0:07:38.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems I'm the first one to finish.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.90,0:07:39.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was tasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.52,0:07:53.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose I'll be moving on as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.92,0:07:54.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Count me in, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.96,0:07:55.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just finished eating.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.94,0:07:57.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.38,0:08:02.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's time!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.02,0:08:03.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Utensils down!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.20,0:08:06.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With that, we've determined\Nour top ten finalists.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.98,0:08:09.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The finals will take place in two hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.46,0:08:12.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, we've brought in a\Ntheater troupe to entertain you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.40,0:08:17.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And of course, we hope you'll sample some\Nof our delicious offerings while you wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.66,0:08:22.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.88,0:08:24.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought you'd set up outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.60,0:08:30.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is great. I was feeling thirsty!\NAh, so the troupe is putting on a play.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.38,0:08:36.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Farm that calls happiness, huh?\NI've never heard of it. Oh, it's time.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:39.66,0:08:42.62,sign_12460_118_The_program_ends,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,150)\bord0\shad0}The program ends
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.46,0:08:47.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was actually pretty good uh-huh\Ncan't say I expected that Wow I didn't See
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.04,0:08:54.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that twist coming at all hey Lamas don't\Nyou have the finals oh I forgot All right,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.86,0:08:55.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.77,0:08:56.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.94,0:08:57.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good luck, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.10,0:09:01.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.56,0:09:03.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the eating contest finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.06,0:09:05.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Contestants to the stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.04,0:09:11.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Music?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.62,0:09:14.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a new function\NI gained at rank two.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.30,0:09:16.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I figured I could liven things up with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.16,0:09:19.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is the band hidden somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.78,0:09:22.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I hope everybody's\Nhaving a great time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.16,0:09:26.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the finals,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.40,0:09:29.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,whoever eats the most within the time\Nlimit will be crowned the champion.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.70,0:09:32.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish all LARC finalists\Nthe best of luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.20,0:09:34.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get ready, set, eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.56,0:09:39.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm rooting for you, shut up now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.02,0:09:41.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, band of buttons!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.04,0:09:42.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.48,0:09:46.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They brought out a new dish!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.36,0:09:47.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.27,0:09:48.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those are crepes,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.48,0:09:51.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,mercilessly stuffed with all kinds\Nof fruits and other ingredients.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.50,0:09:54.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fruit filling was\Nprovided by yours truly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.34,0:09:58.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's a sweet dish.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.38,0:09:59.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks super tasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.80,0:10:01.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd love to try one of those.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.68,0:10:09.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's making that big\Nfruit thingy look amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.38,0:10:11.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is making me feel\Nhungry now, dang it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.74,0:10:21.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, get a load of Suco!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.76,0:10:23.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's crushing plate after plate!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.52,0:10:26.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is coming down to a\Nduel between her and Shui!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.10,0:10:38.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I managed to finish it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.44,0:10:40.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew you could pull it off, little girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.80,0:10:43.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe she\Nbeat the band of glums!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.22,0:10:44.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Congrats!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.36,0:10:51.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too bad that Goat Guy\Ndidn't really stand out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.10,0:10:53.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he did a lot better than I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.84,0:11:02.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't look so disappointed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.68,0:11:05.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, the grand prize\Nfor today's winner is Boxxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.68,0:11:07.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can use him for free for one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.18,0:11:09.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.09,0:11:10.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxxo, please say it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.80,0:11:14.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did tell us that we could come to\Nyou if we needed any help after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.66,0:11:15.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.12,0:11:20.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I've made a decent number of points\Nselling cola, and I did promise I'd help.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.76,0:11:23.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it's just one day, I should be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.70,0:11:26.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Check it out, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.30,0:11:29.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won the eating competition,\Nso Boxxo belongs to me today.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.14,0:11:31.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're so lucky, Shui.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.68,0:11:33.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish I could have Boxxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.38,0:11:36.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, you can pretty much eat\Nand drink as much as you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.18,0:11:37.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was some good eating, Shui.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.98,0:11:40.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since we've got Boxo here,\Nthis is the perfect chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.38,0:11:44.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To go monster hunting we could\Nuse some more funds good idea huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.56,0:11:47.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop trying to take him away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.42,0:11:52.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won box of ferrian square he's mine\Nyou hear plus we already have plans
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.88,0:11:57.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we're going on a date to the origin\Nstratum what's the origin stratum?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.94,0:12:04.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't been here in\Nforever so many memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.52,0:12:07.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Truthfully i actually\Ncome here fairly often.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.60,0:12:11.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't know you were gonna\Ntake him to the first stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.38,0:12:15.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, in that case, go on ahead.\NYou've got better things to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.94,0:12:17.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did the captain mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.70,0:12:19.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there something special here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.62,0:12:22.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey Shui where are we headed to?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.36,0:12:23.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just a bit further.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.84,0:12:30.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.64,0:12:31.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,finally made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.72,0:12:33.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello is anyone there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.64,0:12:34.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm back for a visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.74,0:12:36.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey look it's Shui.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.94,0:12:43.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think Sister Shui came\Nback to see us. I heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.46,0:12:45.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone's so excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.40,0:12:48.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's good to see you. Welcome home.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.48,0:12:50.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's great to be back, Madam Director?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.10,0:12:53.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that a new friend of\Nyours standing behind you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.88,0:12:54.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.79,0:12:56.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We adventure together!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.34,0:12:58.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.84,0:13:01.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's wonderful to meet a friend of Shui's?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.18,0:13:03.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't we continue our\Ntalk inside the house?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.50,0:13:04.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, come on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.02,0:13:06.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.93,0:13:08.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, ma 'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.94,0:13:12.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will the floor even hold\Nyour weight? Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.82,0:13:18.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It may not seem like it, but this\Nbox is actually a magical item.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.00,0:13:23.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you press on it here, it'll\Ngive you some tasty stuff. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.02,0:13:27.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want a recommendation,\Nthis brown stuff is delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.76,0:13:29.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about that one?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.50,0:13:30.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a crunchy snack.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.02,0:13:32.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's salty but really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.66,0:13:52.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you put all these\Ncute kids in front of me,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.20,0:13:54.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have a choice but\Nto give stuff out for free.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.72,0:13:56.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Any vending machine would do the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.48,0:13:59.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is the box glowing like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.50,0:14:08.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a wall!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.88,0:14:10.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.34,0:14:11.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.62,0:14:13.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love it! Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.80,0:14:17.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But wait, that's not all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.90,0:14:19.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.46,0:14:20.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here it comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.78,0:14:27.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone, when you're done, go ahead\Nand put your wet clothes in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.40,0:14:28.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma 'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.46,0:14:31.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.52,0:14:33.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's washing all our clothes. Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.12,0:14:38.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never expected Boxo could do the laundry.\NMagic items these days sure are handy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.14,0:14:40.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go take a bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.54,0:14:43.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He should be done washing\Neverything by the time we get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.28,0:14:44.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aww.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.92,0:14:49.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys better make it snappy, or\Nthe licking monster will catch you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.24,0:14:51.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't run away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.78,0:14:54.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.24,0:14:56.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no hot water in the bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.54,0:14:58.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodness, that's certainly not ideal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.70,0:15:01.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who was supposed to be on bath duty today?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.34,0:15:04.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're really sorry about this, ma 'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.52,0:15:06.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were having so much\Nfun playing with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.28,0:15:07.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shibby, we totally forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.12,0:15:08.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.18,0:15:10.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's good you told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.52,0:15:11.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.94,0:15:15.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember, everybody makes mistakes,\Nbut we shouldn't cover it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.10,0:15:19.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instead, we should always take\Nresponsibility for them and learn from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.68,0:15:20.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.08,0:15:25.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the time we gather the water and\Nwood to heat it up, it'll be too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.22,0:15:27.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't we skip the baths for today?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.54,0:15:30.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll make sure we wash\Nup properly tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.08,0:15:33.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Voxo?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.56,0:15:34.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.48,0:15:35.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.74,0:15:38.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Behold, my fourth form change of the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.56,0:15:40.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've turned into a hot\Nspring vending machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.06,0:15:42.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you planning?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.40,0:15:45.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is something supposed to\Ncome out of this hose?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.90,0:15:47.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, look at it go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.70,0:15:49.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The tub is full of water already!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.46,0:15:51.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Waxo is amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.60,0:15:53.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.34,0:15:55.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.20,0:15:58.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.20,0:15:59.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't run, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.82,0:16:17.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Boxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.24,0:16:19.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We appreciate everything\Nyou've done for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.60,0:16:20.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.66,0:16:21.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To be honest with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.08,0:16:26.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,whenever Shui would come home, it seemed\Nlike she was worried about something.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.28,0:16:28.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a relief to see her\Nso happy and relaxed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.10,0:16:31.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's in no small part thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.36,0:16:33.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you'll continue to look after her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.32,0:16:34.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.20,0:16:47.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I might as well give them a couple\Nextra sets of clothes and towels, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.42,0:16:49.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.33,0:16:53.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'm overthinking it, but am I\Njust teaching them to expect handouts?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.14,0:16:56.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm never sure how involved I\Nshould get in these situations.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.44,0:16:59.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Foxo, your lights started flickering.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.92,0:17:03.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You weren't thinking about\Nsomething weird again, were you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.56,0:17:05.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.47,0:17:08.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently I do that involuntarily\Nwhen I'm lost in thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.66,0:17:10.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really should have more confidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.18,0:17:14.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone here is smiling\Nbecause of all the good food.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.08,0:17:16.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's thanks to you. So be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.94,0:17:19.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lamas is amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.56,0:17:22.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She can tell what a vending\Nmachine like me is feeling,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.20,0:17:24.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and then she knows the\Nperfect thing to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.92,0:17:29.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every day I count my lucky stars\Nit was Lamas who first found me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.34,0:17:39.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're in a cave where you\Ncan't even see the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.56,0:17:42.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's nearly impossible to\Ntell morning from night.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.60,0:17:46.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxo, thanks for everything\Nthat you did today.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.92,0:17:49.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been a while since\NI've seen everyone so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.12,0:17:51.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.82,0:17:55.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Giving all that away\Nmust have been pricey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.86,0:17:57.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll make it up to you, I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.98,0:17:59.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just need a little time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.52,0:18:01.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.56,0:18:04.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you want your money now, too bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.46,0:18:05.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.00,0:18:09.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.34,0:18:11.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you saying I don't\Nneed to pay you back?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.56,0:18:12.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.82,0:18:19.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was kind of thirsty,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.54,0:18:20.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so this is perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.70,0:18:23.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, don't chug it like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.88,0:18:27.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could even win a reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.94,0:18:32.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, this is your\Nfirst time here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.56,0:18:36.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you know everyone entering the dungeon\Nhas to pass through the origin stratum?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.80,0:18:40.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad to get to the other strata?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.46,0:18:43.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Adventurers have to make their\Nway through this stratum first,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.30,0:18:45.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and then they take the\Ntransfer circle out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.64,0:18:46.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a test.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.55,0:18:50.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If somebody can't handle the journey through\Nthe origin stratum, then it's a sign?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.06,0:18:54.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and they have no business trying\Nto go deeper into the dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.08,0:18:54.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.99,0:18:57.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're saying that all\Nthe non-hunters I've met
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.22,0:18:59.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so far have had to make\Ntheir way through this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.60,0:19:03.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But because of that, there are a\Nlot of people left in the stratum?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.34,0:19:07.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who, for whatever reason, never\Nmade it to the transfer circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.12,0:19:09.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is where the children\Nwho were abandoned gather,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.02,0:19:12.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,stuck in a place where they\Ncan't even see the sun?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.24,0:19:14.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or feel the wind on their faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.38,0:19:15.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're trapped here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.60,0:19:21.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I want is for the children\Nin this stratum to be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.58,0:19:22.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.49,0:19:25.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For some reason, I've been\Na real blabbermouth today.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.26,0:19:28.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forget everything I\Nsaid, okay? It's bedtime!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.52,0:19:29.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll see you tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.84,0:19:37.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So where is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.74,0:19:39.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're almost there, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.58,0:19:42.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heard they've got some\Nkind of special magic item.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.40,0:19:45.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been a while since\Nanyone's tried to steal me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.36,0:19:49.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I should have expected this\Nsince this area isn't exactly safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.50,0:19:52.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're saying this giant box\Nspits out as much food as we want?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.02,0:19:54.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I saw it with my own eyes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.00,0:19:57.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What should I do here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.56,0:20:00.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could wake up Lamas and\NShwee with a loud noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.26,0:20:03.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if things go south, the kids\Ncould be put into harm's way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.10,0:20:04.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.70,0:20:09.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you jerks are ready for this\Nweek's vending machine surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.82,0:20:10.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.76,0:20:12.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's the smoke coming from?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.20,0:20:14.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, is anyone else hearing that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.00,0:20:20.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it kind of sounds like flowing water\Nand howling wind, but that can be like...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.86,0:20:21.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.77,0:20:23.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There aren't any rivers\Nor springs around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.90,0:20:25.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must be imagining things.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.40,0:20:28.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And finally, the burial.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.06,0:20:32.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.24,0:20:34.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We gotta get the hell out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.46,0:20:36.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please wait for us, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.98,0:20:38.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.14,0:20:41.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I look forward to serving you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.72,0:20:47.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did this really happen\Nwhile we were sleeping?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.66,0:20:48.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I recognize them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.10,0:20:52.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're a couple of former\Nhunters who set up a base nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.58,0:20:54.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So they turn to a life of crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.32,0:20:56.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such naughty boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.06,0:20:59.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.26,0:21:02.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be heading out for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.44,0:21:05.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you two look after\Nthe children for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.90,0:21:06.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma 'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.64,0:21:14.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been forever since I've seen\Nher actually get mad like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.54,0:21:18.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Madam Director's the person\Nwho taught me archery.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.48,0:21:19.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She used to be a hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.40,0:21:24.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently she and Director Bear used\Nto go raiding together all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.42,0:21:27.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even Captain Kerioyl admits\Nshe's a lot better than him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.80,0:21:29.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I didn't know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.12,0:21:35.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,About an hour later, she returned\Nwith a big smile on her face.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.02,0:21:37.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.22,0:21:40.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gave them a stern talking to, and they\Nwere more than happy to listen to reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.06,0:21:44.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They promised that they'd never\Ntry to meddle with you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.94,0:21:48.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure that quiver was full\Nof arrows when she left earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.64,0:21:50.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.50,0:21:53.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Shwee's teacher for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.12,0:21:54.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.44,0:21:58.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does that mean Shwee's gonna grow up\Nto be like Madam Director one day?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.42,0:22:01.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.88,0:22:02.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.82,0:22:20.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.42,0:22:46.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you, but I'm\Nhappy with this moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.96,0:22:54.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Today is a day for a\Nday, always for a soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.66,0:23:39.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I look forward to serving you again.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:35.01,0:23:40.01,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,upper left text,0,0,0,,{\pos(51,65)\fs14}Next Time
